# Book build artifacts.
#
# The PDF and the concatenated manuscript are deliberately NOT tracked:
# the PDF is the paid Leanpub artifact, and `combined.md` is a transient
# build product. Anyone who wants to rebuild the PDF locally can do so
# with `python build_book.py` against the markdown source in this
# directory.

BuildYourOwnOS.pdf
combined.md
_pass1.pdf

